# Customer accounts now use self-owned Better Auth (email sign-in code),
# which is same-origin and needs NO public build-time key.
#
# Runtime secrets live in Cloudflare Pages env (not here):
#   BETTER_AUTH_SECRET          random 32+ char string
#   BETTER_AUTH_URL             https://adrianrasmussen.com
#   RESEND_API_KEY              existing (already set)
#   RESEND_FROM_EMAIL           noreply@adrianrasmussen.com
#   ADMIN_EMAILS                comma-separated verified admin email allowlist
#   REGISTRY_STEP_UP_SECRET     separate high-entropy registry recovery secret
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID            optional, enables Google only when paired
#   GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET        optional, enables Google only when paired
#   GOOGLE_DRIVE_REFRESH_TOKEN  optional, enables offline-ledger sync to Drive
#                               (drive.file scope; reuses the client above)
#   GOOGLE_DRIVE_FOLDER_ID      optional target folder for the ledger file
#
# (The old Clerk publishable key was removed when login moved in-house.)
